        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Update</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2026/08/08 <strong>ver.1.2.0</strong> Update (Korean language added, Chapter 5 still image fixed, pattern on Hermann's character sprite fixed, text readability adjusted, ending song volume adjusted)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2025/11/27 <strong>ver.1.0.1</strong> (Fixed a bug where Traditional Chinese text would display as English in Chapters 2 and 5.)<br>2025/11/27 <strong>ver.1.0.0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Future Schedule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epilogue scheduled for free addition in 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;&quot;Knights College 2&quot;&quot; is the sequel to the previous title, &quot;&quot;Knights College.&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the story is connected, we recommend enjoying the first game before playing this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Development Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Streaming gameplay footage of &quot;&quot;Knights College 2&quot;&quot; is allowed up to Chapter 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Due to the story-driven nature of this visual novel, streaming from Chapter 2 onward is prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・This game is a story-focused visual novel, so please be careful to avoid spoilers if you have not played it yet.<br>　For those who have already played, we would appreciate it if you could refrain from posting spoilers in the review section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Supported Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese, English, Traditional Chinese，Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argo, a young man who had been living a quiet life in a rural fishing village,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >has entered the Knight Academy to become a knight and successfully advanced to his second year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The academy, composed of students from the homeland Frontail and international students from neighboring Harshreich,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >welcomes new students from each country again this year, starting a new season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/e2d2214f172422fbda00ba1f7a5ea835.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/e2d2214f172422fbda00ba1f7a5ea835.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the dragon Baten from Ludovigo joins as a student,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the knight commander Bayfreed returns from his expedition,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bringing even more color to Argo’s academy life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ New Features in &quot;2&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Graphics Overhaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Character sprites have been renewed, and emotes have been added to the dialogue screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Character expressions now animate in sync with the sprites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/c805f53ef23cbfc3dcded79b6212bc8f.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/c805f53ef23cbfc3dcded79b6212bc8f.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/0d925e12a19894dd1bc4f1270066c6e4.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/0d925e12a19894dd1bc4f1270066c6e4.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ New Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　New characters include Gamir, a new student from Frontail; Felix, an international student from Harshreich;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　and Knight Commander Bayfreed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　(Another character appears later in the game.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/02b333643afc07e9a0b0a0ad2f827b7a.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/02b333643afc07e9a0b0a0ad2f827b7a.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ New Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　In addition to cards from the previous title, 100 types of cards including newly added ones will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/273d1ce5b15f6b0af9ab43d4f3e805ca.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/273d1ce5b15f6b0af9ab43d4f3e805ca.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Roommate Selection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　In the previous game, roommates were fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　In this game, you can choose between Theo and Grantley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/7354958e99c230410f25945f205f5d62.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/7354958e99c230410f25945f205f5d62.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;&quot;Knights College 2,&quot;&quot; all actions such as conversations and movement are made through card selections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtaining new cards unlocks conversations or opens new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/7e50608edf729e6f3ecf1150dd4acd4b.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/7e50608edf729e6f3ecf1150dd4acd4b.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/a4ba22b002cc466102791bbededd857a.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/a4ba22b002cc466102791bbededd857a.avif?t=1786151258 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Bath Talking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in the previous game, you can take baths with someone during bath time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get to see a different side of the characters than you would during the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/dcf464a4d4036cdb971f2bd87bfef509.avif?t=1786151258\" data-big-src=http